We are a leading trading platform that is ambitiously expanding to the four corners of the globe. Our top-rated products have won prestigious industry awards for their cutting-edge technology and seamless client experience. We deliver only the best, so we are always in search of the best people to join our ever-growing talented team.
We’re seeking a Senior Product Designer to join our team, dedicated to building intuitive and impactful financial products for a global audience. In this role, you’ll collaborate closely with a talented design team to address customer needs, elevate design standards, and ensure a seamless user experience. Using data-driven insights alongside your skills in design, research, and prototyping, you’ll develop user-friendly solutions for complex challenges. If you’re eager to bring compelling designs to life and create exceptional digital experiences, we’d love to meet you.


Responsibilities:
• Create intuitive, visually appealing interfaces that enhance user engagement.

• Be the voice of the user, embedding their needs into every design decision with insights and research.

• Work hand-in-hand with product, engineering, and stakeholders to transform ideas into reality.

• Collaborate with researchers to uncover actionable feedback, guiding meaningful usability improvements.

• Develop interactive prototypes to test and illustrate design concepts.

• Define and maintain design guidelines, bringing consistency across all products.

• Lead design initiatives with balance and clarity, adapting to timelines while juggling multiple priorities.

• Design user journeys that turn complex tasks into simple, delightful journeys.

• Improve product performance post-launch, focusing on continuous, user-centered enhancements.

• Help maintain, evolve and improve the design system, as well as using it as a toolkit to ensure consistency.

Requirements:
• 5+ years of experience designing complex commercial apps;

• A portfolio showcasing strong design work;

• Experience in SaaS products;

• Figma expertise and strong knowledge of components and design systems;

• You have experience working with and evolving design systems, across iOS, Android and responsive web;

• Strategic thinker with the ability to articulate design decisions clearly;

• Skilled at understanding the technical impact of design choices;

• Self-directed, with the ability to take ownership of the design process;

• Strong UX focus and a deep understanding of human behavior;

• Clean, refined visual design sense;

• Love to solve problems and be challenged;

• A continuous learner, eager to grow both personally and with the team;

• You are a proactive, confident and effective communicator. You are able to present your work, and articulate your design decisions clearly and confidently to a range of stakeholders.

What you will get in return:
• Competitive Salary: We believe great work deserves great pay! Your skills and talents will be rewarded with a salary that makes you feel valued and motivated.

• Work-Life Harmony: Join a company that genuinely cares about you—because your life outside of work matters just as much as your time on the clock. #LI-Hybrid

• Annual Performance Bonus: Your hard work doesn’t go unnoticed! Celebrate your achievements with a well-deserved annual bonus tied to your performance.

• Generous Time Off: Need a breather? Our annual leave policy lets you recharge and enjoy life outside of work without a worry.

• Employee Referral Program: Love working here? Share the love! Bring your talented friends on board and get rewarded for growing our awesome team.

• Comprehensive Health & Pension Benefits: From medical insurance to pension plans, we’ve got your back. Plus, location-specific benefits and perks!

• Workation Wonderland: Live your digital nomad dreams with 30 extra days to work remotely from anywhere in the world (some restrictions apply). Adventure awaits!

• Volunteer Days: Make a difference! Take two additional paid days each year to support causes you care about and give back to the community.

Be a key player at the forefront of the digital assets movement, propelling your career to new heights! Join a dynamic and rapidly expanding company that values and rewards talent, initiative, and creativity. Work alongside one of the most brilliant teams in the industry.

